type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんのダンスすごく見やすい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、言われて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今回のステージを終えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分への課題も更に見つかったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点も沢山あったと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次に皆さんの前に立つまでには完璧にしておきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一段でも高いクオリティーを、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一歩でも進んだパフォーマンスを。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのときそのときを、ただ楽しかっただけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は終わらせたくないから。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に甘えず、現状に満足せず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上を目指して頑張って行きたい＼(^o^)／きらぴかっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、とにかく乃木坂46のメンバーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを支えて応援してくださるみなさんのことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだなって改めて感じましたヾ(＠⌒▽⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに、味噌カツをいただきました（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても美味しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b